{"unit_id":"tag:06T7:statement","translation":"存在预形变范畴（predeformation categories），它们具有满足（<REF_0001>）的万有形式对象（versal formal object），却不满足 (S2)。一个简单的例子是取 <MATH_0001>，其中 <MATH_0002> 是一个有限（finite）的非平凡子群（nontrivial subgroup）。具体而言，映射（map）<MATH_0003> 是光滑（smooth）的，但 <MATH_0004> 的切空间（tangent space）不具有自然的 <MATH_0005> 向量空间（vector space）结构（因为它是一个 <MATH_0006> 向量空间（vector space）被一个有限群（finite group）取商（quotient）所得）。\n","allowed_english":["S"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"predeformation categories","target_term":"预形变范畴"},{"source_term":"versal formal object","target_term":"万有形式对象"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"nontrivial subgroup","target_term":"非平凡子群"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"tangent space","target_term":"切空间"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"finite group","target_term":"有限群"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"predeformation categories","target_term":"预形变范畴","context":"术语表未批准此范畴名称。"},{"source_term":"versal formal object","target_term":"万有形式对象","context":"形式对象的万有性译名待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"子群的有限性。"},{"source_term":"nontrivial subgroup","target_term":"非平凡子群","context":"例中所取子群。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"例中的光滑映射。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"映射的光滑性。"},{"source_term":"tangent space","target_term":"切空间","context":"预形变范畴的切空间。"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间","context":"切空间的线性结构。"},{"source_term":"finite group","target_term":"有限群","context":"取商所用的群。"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"向量空间按群作用取商。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06T8:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是一个满足 (S2) 且具有万有形式对象（versal formal object）的预形变范畴（predeformation category）。则它的极小万有形式对象（minimal versal formal object）满足（<REF_0001>）。\n","allowed_english":["S"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"versal formal object","target_term":"万有形式对象"},{"source_term":"predeformation category","target_term":"预形变范畴"},{"source_term":"minimal versal formal object","target_term":"极小万有形式对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"versal formal object","target_term":"万有形式对象","context":"万有形式对象的译名待决。"},{"source_term":"predeformation category","target_term":"预形变范畴","context":"范畴名称未获术语批准。"},{"source_term":"minimal versal formal object","target_term":"极小万有形式对象","context":"极小万有形式对象的完整术语。"}],"notes":[]}
